      "sourceLabels": [
        "Wikipedia"
      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Stafford_Springs%2C_Connecticut",
      "category": "history",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "Founded in 1853, Warren Mills became one of the village’s most prominent operations and is among the oldest continuously running textile mills in the U.S.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
